From 81c64b8f7ccc7ba8d6b3f9641fdf095e90c155da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:47:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Documentation: fixes found by the check of the review

An independent check of the documentation fixes found: the reference of computeMeasure and computeIntegral (functions of the behaviour integrators, not of the partial quadrature functions), the validity flag of the Faltus centers (made invalid by any failure since the previous fix), the memory of hypre following the linear solvers only in the gpu and mixed modes, the variable of the post-processings computation ignored with any --execution option, the regularization of Faltus et al. in plane stress not computed by kernels, two code snippets of the curves missing a brace, and two items of the changelog. sphinx-build -W and Doxygen give no warning.
---
 CHANGELOG.md                                          |  5 +++--
 docs/source/user_guide/batch_computations.rst         | 11 ++++++-----
 docs/source/user_guide/behaviour_integrators.rst      |  3 ++-
 docs/source/user_guide/mesh/curves.rst                |  4 ++--
 .../post_processings/general_post_processings.rst     |  8 +++++---
 include/MFEMMGIS/Batch/Faltus.hxx                     |  6 ++----
 include/MFEMMGIS/Config.hxx                           | 11 ++++++-----
 7 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

